{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Thus: a plumb line</b> — it has no cognate, and in the Ishmaelite tongue it is lead. The meaning: for I shall set a wall of lead in the midst of My people, and I will not pass over it, to see it by way of parable. Some say: a passing over, as in: and his majesty is a passing over of transgression."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:27.149149597Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}